-// selection back from a plain click.
+// second chord left to mean "the other browser" — ⇧ takes that job here.
+// Elsewhere a bare click opens the system browser and ⌘ opens the in-app pane;
+// here it's ⌘ to open and ⇧⌘ for the pane, which keeps both gestures reachable
+// without stealing the selection back from a plain click.
